-- Benchmark: Load 200 modules and measure peak residency.
-- With lazy BCO generation, peak memory should be significantly lower
-- because bytecode is only generated for modules whose code is actually
-- evaluated, not for every module in the dependency chain.
--
-- This script loads all modules but only evaluates the top-level one.
-- The 199 intermediate modules should NOT have BCOs generated.
:l TopMod.hs
topF 42
